     <td><para unique="1261845">B</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261847">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261849">(AVX512VL AND</para>
      <para unique="1261853">AVX512F) OR AVX10.1 <anchor id="+919504"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261855">Convert 4 packed signed doubleword integers from xmm2/m128/m32bcst to 4 packed double precision floating-point values in ymm1 with writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1261827">EVEX.256.F3.0F.W0 E6 /r</para>
      <para unique="1261828">VCVTDQ2PD ymm1 {k1}{z}, xmm2/m128/m32bcst </para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261832">B</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261834">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261836">AVX10.2<superscript>1</superscript></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261838">Convert 4 packed signed doubleword integers from xmm2/m128/m32bcst to 4 packed double precision floating-point values in ymm1 with writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1261810">EVEX.512.F3.0F.W0 E6 /r</para>
      <para unique="1261811">VCVTDQ2PD zmm1 {k1}{z}, ymm2/m256/m32bcst </para>
